WEBVTT

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:31.860
Just wait and see, Yoko.
I'll defeat you for sure.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.510
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:49.880
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:56.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:13.270
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:20.080
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:26.680
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:34.660
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:39.200
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:43.230
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:46.470
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:52.110
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.610
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:59.520
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.890
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.190
Tightly Tomohane!

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.990
"Tightly Tomohane!"

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.160
Tomohane, time to eat.

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:16.730
Tomohane.

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.200
She's not coming out today, either.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.070
I wonder what happened.

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:23.270
She's definitely in her room.

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:24.410
Could it be...

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.080
Starvation?

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.080
That shouldn't be it.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.520
She's shocked from before.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.680
Before?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:35.620
Among all ten of us,

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.450
she's youngest and most lacking in power.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:42.460
But she tries her best not to hold us back.

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.690
Even so, in our previous fight with Yoko...

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:50.270
At that time,
Yoko targeted Tomohane first.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:55.070
Among the nine of us, she saw
Tomohane as the weak point.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:58.810
I'm sure Tomohane would be frustrated.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.510
Afterwards, she said,

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:03.710
"I'm sorry. It's my fault we lost."

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.320
Sorry, everyone!

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.490
Poor Tomohane.

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:11.550
Let's give her time alone.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.070
Huh?

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.710
Yoko? Are you here?

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:34.880
What's up?

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.810
Dumb face.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:42.080
No, um, my name is Tomohane.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:45.220
I'm honored to see you on this nice day.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.090
Oh, you're from Kaoru's place.
Honored to see you.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.530
You have business with Yoko?

00:03:55.530 --> 00:04:01.270
Yes. I baked a chocolate cake, but I made too much.

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:04.610
So as an apology for the other day,

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:07.280
I was thinking of giving it to her.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.780
Did he figure it out?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.310
You're pretty kind, you know?

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:15.750
You had a fight with her recently, right?

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.020
Even so, you brought this here.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.390
That's not easy.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:24.030
But, sorry to tell you,
Yoko's not here.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.100
Nadeshiko came earlier.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:29.130
Beginning of the World Medical Office?

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:33.400
Yes. The Imperial Court secretly acknowledges our existence.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.940
They have a facility that treats us.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:40.240
Even we Inukami can have infectious disease.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:45.950
That's why we need to get vaccines and checkups once in a while.

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:48.520
I see. But just recently,

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:52.150
we saw a TV special about a vet...

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:54.190
I don't want shots!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.960
Oh my, I guess there is no other way.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:02.130
But Yoko, at the medical office, there are other treatments.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.970
Whisper, whisper...

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.940
What? They really can do that?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:11.770
Not only that. There are others too...

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:12.980
Mumble, mumble...

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.580
It tangles inside and sticks?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.550
Whisper, whisper...

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.080
A satisfying pain?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.280
Mumble, mumble...

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.920
Apply on your face for fair skin?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.820
I'm sure even Master Keita would...

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.060
Fair skin!

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.190
What are they talking about?

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.130
I'll be going then.

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.030
And that's how it is.
She'll be back tomorrow.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:39.700
Is that so.

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.670
Now, don't be so disappointed.

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.510
Just come again tomorrow.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:48.710
Okay, I understand.
I'll go home for today.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.780
Huh?

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.620
That's... Wait, that was quick.

00:05:56.820 --> 00:06:01.220
What? It's hot so it'll rot if I don't eat it quickly.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.430
I'm full.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:04.530
What's wrong?

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.200
Umm...

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.470
Karina?

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.900
Wait, you're Kaoru Kawahira's...

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.640
Yes, it has been a while.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.610
So, uh...?

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:20.910
Mujina.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:21.710
Mujina?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.510
It's a demon.
The department had it in custody.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.050
It escaped during cell cleanup.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:30.420
It's attracted to those with spiritual power.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.250
That's why it came here.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.590
Is that why you look that way, too?

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.490
Yes, this is its doing.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:42.970
How cute.

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:46.070
Oh, it's tiny.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.340
Don't underestimate it.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.610
Darn it.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.880
Mr. Karina?

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:57.180
This is its power.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.080
It bonds objects to other objects.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.180
Ouch, what are you doing?

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:02.990
Ouch.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:05.420
More importantly,

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.960
wouldn't it be trouble if it ran to the city?

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.090
I guess so.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:10.990
That's right.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.230
Keita Kawahira, please assist us.

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.430
All right.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.730
Pay me lots.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.240
- Darn you.
- It's too fast.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.110
I can't catch it at all.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:25.510
Stop it, Keita Kawahira.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:29.210
I know, don't think it's a Mujina.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:33.520
Imagine you're catching a beautiful young girl. Ouch!

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:40.390
Try catching me.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.160
Nadeshiko.

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:46.600
You're amazing, Master Keita.

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:48.630
You caught it? Good job.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.130
What? My stomach...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.640
What's wrong?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.910
Could it be my fault?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.880
Don't!

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:11.690
It got us.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.920
Why did my stomach suddenly?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.530
I'm sorry!

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:22.500
The cake you ate had strong laxatives in it.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.570
What?

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.770
I never expected this.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.770
Why did you do that?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:32.210
Because it's my fault we lost the last fight.

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.580
That's why I tried to defeat Yoko.

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.010
I know how you feel.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.580
But this is just...

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:43.990
Save the lecture for later.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.590
Right now, get the Mujina.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.860
But at this rate...

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.060
I'm sorry...

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.630
Master Keita?

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:59.700
No!

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:01.300
Please forgive me!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.570
Mr. Karina...

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.110
I didn't want to do this either!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.510
A maiden's sacrifice shall not be wasted.

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.210
No way.

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.420
You caused this in the first place!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.790
No!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:29.500
I have been tainted.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.130
People might misunderstand that.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.340
You just went to the restroom.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.310
Besides, little kids like you are not in my range.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:40.780
I'm really sorry.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.180
What's wrong?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:46.420
By the way, you sure this is the right way?

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:53.160
Yes. Purification Flash.
Manifestation x1.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.990
Tomohane Special!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.860
Yes, it's definitely this way.

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.460
A detection ability, huh? Nice!

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:04.300
Now that's an Inukami!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.270
You have a useful power.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.440
Yes.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.370
All right then, let's go.

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:12.770
What's wrong?

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:15.210
Never mind.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.820
"Inukami!"

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:27.820
Woof woof.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.690
"Inukami!"

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.690
Woof woof.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:34.960
Here?

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:37.700
Yes, it's definitely in here.

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.600
You guys, hold on.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.210
Wait for me!

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:48.510
Normally, this would've been
Nadeshiko's job.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.450
Don't put in stuff we don't need.

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:54.420
Tayune, you bully.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.020
It's your fault.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.120
Meany!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.420
Don't "meany" me!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:10:59.990
That is...

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.590
Be quiet. You got it?

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:04.660
Okay.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.170
Just a little bit more.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.270
Hey, Tomohane.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.040
What are you doing?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.410
Wait, you...

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.760
Are you all right?

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:35.490
Yes.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.030
What is going on?

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:38.890
Don't know.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.700
I'll explain later. Please help!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.630
Wait up, you little...!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.840
I won't let you get away.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.610
Darn you.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.310
Purification Flash.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.280
Stop. You'll burn this place down.

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:07.220
What is this?

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.900
Mujina, stop!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:29.910
Found you.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.950
I'll get you!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.220
Got you!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.470
Ouch.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:57.770
Huh?

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:00.780
Yay! The spell wore off!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:06.880
Don't touch me there.

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:11.290
I'm sorry, I don't intend to...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.090
Can you stop squirming?

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:15.920
Uh, no, I'm...

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:17.630
Oh my, how bold.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:18.560
No, I...

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:22.530
You got it nice, Karina.
Switch with me.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:27.970
You!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:39.980
I'm going. I will catch it!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:41.550
Wait, not alone!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.920
Tomohane.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.590
What's wrong?

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:51.990
I can see it.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:56.900
That's right. Your ability is seeing the future, isn't it?

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.770
A restroom door. Everyone together.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.370
In a cramped space...

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.100
No!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.480
Our butts are stuck together!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:12.450
Dear God. Why put me through such cruel trials?!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:14.420
What's going on?

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:19.720
I'll explain later. That's why, what's important now is...

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.690
Stop.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.140
I can't see!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.210
Somebody, help me!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:00.700
I found it.

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:04.800
Oops, here I go.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.300
Huh?

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.110
Mujina.

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.710
I'm too tired, I can't fly.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:18.980
I may have used too much power.
But I have to go.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:27.090
Mujina, wait for me!

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:41.770
Did I make you wait?

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.270
Geez.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.780
No, no, no.

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.280
It's disgusting.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.920
- What's wrong?
- Is she lost?

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.420
What's with that kid?

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.820
I don't know.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.670
Excuse me, let me pass.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:25.010
Mujina.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.580
Oh my, I'm sorry.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.740
Be careful from now on, okay?

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.880
Do one good deed a day.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.900
Mujina, please.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.460
Caution

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.740
Mujina!

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:57.940
I found it.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:04.450
Furano, are you sure it's around here?

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.580
I saw it.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:09.350
Tomohane standing on a railway by the river.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.750
The Mujina is also close.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:13.460
She must be hungry.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:14.460
Hurry up, pervert!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.430
The pervert today is Karina.

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.660
And besides, switch with me, will you?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:23.600
- Not happening!
- Darn.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:32.010
Mujina.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.520
It's easily scared.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:45.150
That's why it kept running around.

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.160
No, Mujina.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.730
Mujina, stop.

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.100
Mujina!

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.910
Huh?

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.180
I'm flying.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:02.530
Oh, no. I'm losing my power.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:07.700
Master Keita, you came.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:22.020
I'm glad the spell wore off.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.020
Why did it wear off, though?

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.750
It must've passed out.

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:29.590
While passed out, it loses its bonding power.

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:31.330
The Mujina's trait.

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.190
Really?

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.000
I'm really sorry.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.270
Apologize to Sendan and the others.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.170
And to Yoko too.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.640
You're competing with Yoko, right?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.410
You can punch or fight each other.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:53.380
But I hate dirty tactics like this.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.680
Okay.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:58.290
If you understand, that's good...

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:02.420
Seems like it knows it owes its life to you.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:05.290
Mujina!

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.660
How about it?

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:13.270
If you can be responsible, will you take care of it?

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.200
Really?

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.500
Of course.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:19.770
I understand. I will care for it.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:22.410
What should its name be?

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:26.180
Your color is like a marron cake, so Marro.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.020
Phew, everything is resolved.

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:32.490
Not at all. Think about our position.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:34.060
The restroom...

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:35.520
It can't be helped.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:41.400
It was Tomohane's fault to begin with.
We have to endure it.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:46.800
Well, he did save Tomohane in the end.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:50.970
What are you doing?

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:55.510
I thought I'd make sure that
Mujina's spell has worn off.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:57.910
It hasn't worn off yet.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.320
Idiot!

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.650
Divine punishment!

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:07.460
I can't leave you alone!

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.220
You're already done?

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.830
Fortunately, yes.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:16.300
I hurried home because I wanted to see you, and look.

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:17.200
Wait.

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:18.970
Let me explain.

00:22:18.970 --> 00:22:20.340
Not a chance.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:22.240
Did something happen?

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:24.510
Yeah, many things.

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:32.310
Master Keita is vulgar, silly, and just can't be helped.

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:34.920
But he's like Master Kaoru.

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:36.950
Master Kaoru?

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:40.190
Master Kaoru is a very kind person.

00:22:40.560 --> 00:22:42.920
But Master Keita is too.

00:22:45.060 --> 00:22:45.930
Indeed.

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.960
Don't think you can fool me, you pervert!

00:22:51.630 --> 00:22:54.900
Curse you, curse you!

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:56.470
Next episode preview

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:59.710
Gender mixed public baths were common in Japan.

00:22:59.710 --> 00:23:04.080
After much reform, the baths became separated.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:06.280
But the concept of separate baths

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:09.880
wasn't established until around the 20th century.

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:13.320
Men's bath for men.
Women's bath for women.

00:23:13.990 --> 00:23:15.490
And cats...

00:23:16.360 --> 00:23:17.530
Next on Inukami.

00:23:17.990 --> 00:23:19.530
"Digging at the Mixed Bath!"

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:19.930
Everyone, do not put your towel in the bath. Never!

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:24.930
Digging at the Mixed Bath!
